{"id":"ma_gico","lemma":"mágico","pos":"adj","rank":2522,"glosses":["magic, magical","wonderful"],"ipa":"/ˈmaxiko/","forms":{"feminine":"mágica","masculinePlural":"mágicos","femininePlural":"mágicas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-m%C3%A1gico.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso fue mágico.","en":"That was magic.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441178","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Ese fue sin duda un instante mágico.","en":"That was without doubt a magical moment.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"instant, moment"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"without a doubt"]]},{"text":"Fue mágico.","en":"It was magic.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438110","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Este anillo es un objeto mágico que da gran poder a su usuario.","en":"This ring is a magic item that gives great power to its user.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693620","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"ring"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"object"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null,{"g":"to be able to, can"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"user"}]},{"text":"El mago agitó su varita mágica y despareció sin dejar rastro.","en":"The wizard waved his magic wand and disappeared into thin air.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"magician, sorcerer"},{"g":"to shake","l":"agitar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"wand"},null,{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"without"},{"g":"to leave"},{"g":"sign"}]}]}